R: Jumps, subroutines and the computed jump.
10 T:LINE NUMBERS ARE JUMP TARGETS TOO
C:#MATCH=2
J:*ONE,*TWO,*THREE
T:NOT REACHED
*ONE
T:ONE
J:*AFTER
*TWO
T:TWO
J:*AFTER
*THREE
T:THREE
*AFTER
R: #MATCH out of range falls through to the next statement.
C:#MATCH=9
J:*ONE,*TWO
T:FELL THROUGH
U:*SUB
U:*SUB
C:#N=0
*LOOP
C:#N=#N+1
T:LOOP #N
J(#N<3):*LOOP
C:#DONE=1
J(#DONE):*OUT
T:NOT REACHED EITHER
*OUT
T:JUMPING BACK TO LINE 10 WOULD LOOP FOREVER, SO WE STOP.
E:
T:NOT REACHED AT ALL
*SUB
T:  IN THE SUBROUTINE (DEPTH #DEPTH)
C:#DEPTH=#DEPTH+1
E:
